      <a class="pcard reveal" href="/mercedes-service-a-vs-b">
        <div class="thumb"><span class="ptag">Maintenance</span><img src="/assets/mercedes-gle-service.jpeg" alt="Mercedes GLE service" loading="lazy" width="600" height="360"></div>
        <div class="pc-body">
          <h3>Mercedes Service A vs B — Explained</h3>
          <p>What each service includes, when it’s due, and what it costs.</p>
          <div class="pmeta"><span>Feb 2026</span><span class="dot"></span><span>5 min</span></div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="pcard reveal" href="/audi-maintenance-cost-san-antonio">
        <div class="thumb"><span class="ptag">Maintenance</span><img src="/assets/audi-rs3-brake-service.jpeg" alt="Audi brake service" loading="lazy" width="600" height="360"></div>
        <div class="pc-body">
          <h3>Audi Maintenance Cost &amp; Service Schedule</h3>
          <p>The factory schedule and the real costs, minor to major service.</p>
          <div class="pmeta"><span>Feb 2026</span><span class="dot"></span><span>5 min</span></div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="pcard reveal" href="/porsche-maintenance-cost-san-antonio">
        <div class="thumb"><span class="ptag">Maintenance</span><img src="/assets/porsche-718-on-lift.jpeg" alt="Porsche on the lift" loading="lazy" width="600" height="360"></div>
        <div class="pc-body">
          <h3>Porsche Maintenance Cost</h3>
          <p>Minor vs major service for 911, Cayenne &amp; Macan — and what drives the price.</p>
